2SQL Integration Pipeline Development\",\n      \"explanation\": \"Project P-06 (also identified as the Internal ERP Text2SQL integrated pipeline construction) is a strategic enterprise initiative focused on converting natural language queries into read-only SQL queries via Model Context Protocol (MCP) tooling [Data: Entities (72, 143); Relationships (168)]. The project is directly organized and executed by the Data Platform Team to interface with internal enterprise resource planning systems [Data: Entities (39, 68); Relationships (68, 168)].\\n\\nTechnical initiatives under Project P-06 emphasize data protection and mapping accuracy, specifically addressing department abbreviation normalization and mandatory read-only enforcement to prevent unauthorized database alterations [Data: Entities (48, 83); Relationships (207)].\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"summary\": \"Leadership and Governance Mandate of Yoo Su-seok (Yu Su-seok)\",\n      \"explanation\": \"Yoo Su-seok (also referred to as Yu Su-seok or Yu Suseok) serves as the Senior Principal Engineer and Team Leader of the Data Platform Team [Data: Entities (2, 28, 48, 60); Relationships (29, 57, 75, 110)]. Yoo Su-seok acts as the General Project Manager for Project P-06 as well as Project P-03, coordinating the primary technical research and engineering workflows [Data: Entities (48, 60); Relationships (140, 360, 362)].\\n\\nIn addition to operational management, Yoo Su-seok spearheaded key security and architectural proposals, including co-presenting solutions for department abbreviation normalization and read-only enforcement in Text2SQL, and co-developing query-time ACL trimming engines [Data: Entities (48, 83, 87); Relationships (207, 216)].\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"summary\": \"Executive Authority and Governance by Managing Director Song\",\n      \"explanation\": \"Managing Director Song (also referenced as Song Bonbujang and Song Bon-bu-jang) serves as the Head of the AI Innovation Division, holding comprehensi